{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "schinese", "appid": 548430, "month": "2020-04", "window": 2, "start_date": 1586390400, "end_date": 1586995199, "month_true_total": 183, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:53:52 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "67397183", "author": {"steamid": "76561198306770825", "personaname": "无情的白给机器", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198306770825/", "num_games_owned": 260, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 4598, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1745, "last_played": 1667018029, "avatar": "6baab468be446d5c7e20fbb3b668a625aebda6a6"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "我在这里警告各位矿工：\n1.撤离时永远不要相信矿骡！永远不要跟着矿骡走！因为它会飞檐走壁而你不会。如果有钻机手就跟着钻机手一路钻到撤离点，遇到峡谷就机枪手放滑索（大部分情况下），这比跟着矿骡走要方便的多，前提是4个队友都在矿骡附近\n2.个人观点：没事少打熔岩核心，因为地形高度差太大，有一次我们4个队友打熔岩核心被困在谷底上不来（可能是因为我们太蔡了）\n3.下矿之前可以在酒吧喝酒，建议让队里的大佬请喝酒，因为像我们这样的萌新应该把钱花在升级上。但是最好在喝完后下矿前来一杯叶子情人，不然你会体会到酒精带来的快♂乐\n这些只是个人零散的建议，不成文章，如果有一些错误和误导，希望各位轻喷", "timestamp_created": 1586991557, "timestamp_updated": 1586991557, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 205, "votes_funny": 40, "weighted_vote_score": "0.927035868167877197", "comment_count": 9, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 17, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 11, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 13, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 10, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 15, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 20, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 9, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 14, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 16, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 22, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 1, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 2, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 3, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 4, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 5, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type